<!--
    Russian. The same names and the same format arguments as
    values/strings.xml; `StringsTest` fails when one drifts from the
    other.

    A language is named here the way Russian names one: in lower case,
    so the same word reads as a list item ("русский") and inside a
    sentence. Where English puts a language name in the middle of a
    sentence, the Russian line puts it after a colon instead, since the
    name would otherwise have to be declined differently in each one.
-->
